OL,3,AOasis: Don't Look Back In Anger review
OL,4,A- emotional documentary glosses over
OL,5,Athe hard stuff
OL,6,
OL,7,F"The little things that used to annoy
OL,8,Fus about each other have all gone
OL,9,Faway," says Noel Gallagher of
OL,10,Freconciling with his brother, Liam.
OL,12,F"It's not a power struggle any more."
OL,14,FThe scene comes towards the end of
OL,15,FDon't Look Back In Anger, a sentimental
OL,16,Fand affectionate portrait of the band's
OL,17,Fcomeback tour in 2025. But it's about
OL,18,Fas deep as we get into the band's
OL,19,F15-year hiatus.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
